    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers in excess of 275,000\n\nThis is a well-presented, A-rated of some 97 sqm and was constructed in 2021. \nNo. 8 Cluain Beag offers a high standard of finish throughout topped of by a beautifully landscaped, south-west-facing rear terraced garden with patio and grassed areas and a very handy utility shed. \nOn the ground floor is the living room to the front. The kitchen/dining to the rear has direct access to the SW facing rear garden, and there is a guest WC. Upstairs are three bedrooms, the main bedroom with an en-suite, and family bathroom.\nThe home is conveniently located within walking distance of a range of local amenities, including schools, shops, cafés, services and retail parks. \nMains water and sewage, gas heating, part-sheeted attic providing additional storage space with Stira access, local bus services. Built 2021, 97 sqm semi-detached, gas central heating, residents association 50 Per Annum."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.9m x 2m\nherringbone laminate flooring\n\nUnder-stair storage - 1.9m x 0.8m\nshelving\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 3.5m\nfront facing room with bay window, herringbone laminate flooring and floating shelves\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.5m x 3.5m\ntiled flooring and splashback, electric hob and oven, dishwasher, waist and eye level units, sliding patio door to south-west facing rear garden\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 1.6m\ntiled flooring, WC and WHB\n\nLanding - 3.1m x 1.7m\ncarpeted with side window. Stira access to part-sheeted attic\n\nHot press - 0.9m x 0.7m\nshelving\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.8m\ntiled flooring and bath surround, WC and WHB, mirrored cabinet, floating shelves\n\nMain bedroom - 3.5m x 3.2m\nfront facing room with carpet and built-in double wardrobe\n\nEn-Suite - 1.9m x 1.5m and 0.9m x 0.9m\ntiled flooring and shower surround, WC and WHB, mains shower, mirrored cabinet\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 3.1m\nrear facing room with carpet and built-in double wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m x 2.3m\nrear facing room with carpet and floating shelves\n\nTimber shed - 2.9m x 2.3m\nstanding on concrete base\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>97 sqm semi-detached home</li><li>Living room to the front</li><li>Kitchen/dining to the rear (SW facing)</li><li>Guest WC and understair storage</li><li>3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms upstairs</li><li>Beautifully landscaped SW facing rear garden with shed</li><li>Side gate, rear garden fully enclosed</li><li>Mains services, gas heating, off-street parking</ul>"
      },
